<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Magical Resistance</ansi> mutation

Your body resists the weave of magic. Spells wash over you with
diminished force, but your own conviction frays more quickly.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced incoming magical damage — spells and
  magical effects are far less potent against you

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Conviction-based abilities cost significantly more to use —
  the same resistance that deflects spells hampers your own
  force of will

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
